infinite-patch 1
# Modulation: an LFO drives sizeX, an expression drives rotation; sampled over time.
# Rectangle on purpose: a Star shows an extra "sides" control that shifts every later control index, and the
# key join is probed on the default shape, so `rotation` would land on the wrong slider.
node 1 Source Shape
  id shape
  i shapeType Rectangle
end
node 2 Modulators LFO
  id lfo
end
node 3 Utility Output
  id out
end
cable out 0 shape
mod shape sizeX lfo 0 0 1 0.5
expr shape rotation sin(t) * 90
